# Generated by the weekly search report workflow
seo-report.md

# Hand-made upload bundles from before the deploy workflow existed
*.zip

# Written by a held draft so the correction pass knows what to fix. One run only.
draft-problems.txt

# Source video and photos from the owner: originals live here, never committed or deployed.
# Only the processed stills that are actually used go into src/assets/.
#
# The leading slash matters. Without it this pattern matches any directory called "content" at any
# depth, which silently swallowed src/content/ and would have stopped the Tuesday post being
# committed at all.
/content/

# Local test output of public/api/tap.php when run with the PHP dev server. On the host this
# directory sits outside the web root; locally it would land here, and it holds IP addresses.
/rsk-taps/

# Weekly report outputs, which contain IP addresses. Emailed, never committed.
taps.md
taps-*.csv
email.md
